# Recorded 2026-10-08 from a throwaway slapd (OpenLDAP 2.7.1-0+slaptain1) by testdata/record.sh,
# run in the slaptain slapd-init image of the same vendored build the lab runs.
# Search: ldapsearch -b cn=Monitor -s sub
#   '(|(objectClass=monitoredObject)(objectClass=monitorCounterObject)(objectClass=monitorOperation))' '*' '+'
# — the collector's own filter. A separate recording session from monitor-2.7.1.ldif: the
# same entries, but counters moved. Bound by SASL EXTERNAL over ldapi under the constant
# monitor ACL. Unedited below this header. 43 entries = exactly the union of the three
# upstream-*.ldif sets: no monitorConnection, no monitorContainer, no monitorServer.
#
